# Documentary reconciliation and F0 gate preparation

Authorized by the maintainer request of 2026-11-01. Full route for unresolved operational milestone and persistence decisions; reversible clerical edits use bounded local review within the affected features. This feature accepts the preparation of decision artifacts only. It does not adopt the proposed F0 boundary, implement persistence, clear rights, publish, commit or reaccept the product.

Actors: executor prepares evidence and proposal; maintainer decides milestone/risk/storage scope. Inherited starting record: docs/validation/foundation-current-20261101/criteria.json (21 INCONCLUSIVE, four UNVERIFIED). No independent audit of its tests/matrices is claimed. The five states remain separate from authorization and task completion.

- REQ-01: Reconcile documentary state without transferring skill acceptance to product.
- AC-01 → REQ-01: Nine T004 records agree with their four unchanged scenario definitions and bounded consumer evidence; current summaries link successors and preserve historical limitations.
- REQ-02: Prepare an operationally verifiable F0 closure proposal.
- AC-02 → REQ-02: All seven original F0 rows identify authority/adoption, scope, objective pass condition, oracle, inputs, available evidence, state, limitation and remaining owner/action; risk/platform/persistence decisions remain explicit and no F0 closure is claimed.
- REQ-03: Prepare an actionable persistence decision without implementation.
- AC-03 → REQ-03: ADR compares snapshots, journal and embedded storage against the same integrity/recovery/migration/backup/concurrency/maintenance obligations; proposed feature defines exclusions/dependencies and independently verifiable criteria, with technology/adoption/implementation authorization pending.
- REQ-04: Preserve observations and reexamine only changed dependencies.
- AC-04 → REQ-04: Pre-edit bytes and input-to-observation map exist; changed document inputs receive explicit successor inspections, historical digests are retained, unrelated implementation/oracle bytes and inherited 25-criterion matrix remain unchanged; focused structural/freshness/negative checks record their limits.

## Current decision-preparation scope

The follow-up request authorizes documentary work only: diagnose decision versus
operational gaps, propose persistence after F0/before MVP and prepare equal SQLite
versus snapshot experiments. AC-02 includes a criterion-level matrix and smallest
remaining-work plan; AC-03 includes a common fault corpus and results-first selection
rule. No adopted F0 boundary, experiment grant or technology selection is inferred.

## Authorized quality refinement

The maintainer's “ok, efetue os ajustes recomendados” authorizes recommended
documentary refinements, not a dependency upgrade or operational implementation.
Continue the full route here. REQ-02 / AC-02 additionally require Q01–Q13 to define
coverage denominator/baseline/exceptions, fail-before/pass-after regressions,
